==English==

===Etymology===
Probably {{etyl|yi|en}} {{m|yi|שנויץ|tr=shnoits||snout}}, originally from {{etyl|de|en}} {{m|de|tr=snout, muzzle|Schnauze}}.

===Pronunciation===
